          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4aea4a01c1d4412cb1edbb00e91507b2_l07b04-esta-manana-he-trabajado-mucho.mp3?Expires=1794099558&Signature=vV9TGuXYJMCuLpSbP1mGk2EBlc-zzVUtbgoN3pFmZxQGwxlY7uI8srs6loeY1WYV9VWc8Gq2JC6OhYvYOUCT4OZjQB3GJ6vM35DgH~lu6dwmejqQyVGZ5W2qOy5PC2ZyjiwbrQxcoBV0jlcUYH5RptJzDpSX5~XTkca2XDGjTd7bVncKvUkIfsv5tE2x0s8LnOztGDZvwsi1YgjnQQS83W-oRistbTUXihEq08mgRP-qddoA~BZEgy8iUqIZWU3U5VCWF1sHxxIgKTXzeku86RuBMLsNkNMXm-lOtoKyv38ev1Bdhrn3Y7IY3XbPl755V1F4KDc~53DTK6HeZ3-UWg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
